		(property "Description" "nRF9151 reset button. Omron B3U-1000P (top-actuated, no ground terminal, Omron B3U catalogue). Pulls RST_MCU_DBG to GND, i.e. nRESET through R313 1k: the pin then sees 2.2 V x 1k/(13k+1k) = 0.16 V, below the 0.66 V (0.3 x 2.2 V) threshold (nRF9151 HDG nRESET circuit example). Nordic: hold low >= 5 us."
			(at 119.38 144.78 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
