		(property "Description" "DNP Tag-Connect TC2030-IDC-NL (no-legs) footprint, alternate nRF9151 SWD access for a TC2030-CTX(-NL) cable. Pinout verified from the Tag-Connect TC2030-CTX datasheet: 1 VCC, 2 SWDIO, 3 nRESET, 4 SWCLK, 5 GND, 6 SWO, matching KiCad's Conn_ARM_SWD_TagConnect_TC2030 symbol. NL = no retaining-leg holes; hold the plug by hand or use the TC2030-CLIP."
