				)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "nRF9151 debug/log UART, 4-pin 2.54 mm: 1 GND, 2 DBG_UART_TX (nRF9151 TX -> cable RXD), 3 DBG_UART_RX (cable TXD -> nRF9151 RX), 4 DBG_VREF. Logic levels are +3V3 (nRF9151 VDD_GPIO): use a 3.3 V-logic USB-UART cable (e.g. FTDI TTL-232R-3V3, wire cable GND/RXD/TXD only). Pin 4 is NOT tied to +3V3 unless R314 is fitted, so a cable's VCC (5 V on TTL-232R-3V3) cannot back-feed the board."
			(at 63.5 213.36 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
